     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\"><b>Interactive introductory distance sampling training, first announcement</b></span>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Official registration for the July 2023 workshop will begin the week of 22 May 2023, but applications are now being accepted for the widening participation scholarship (details below).</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>We are offering the training workshop in 10 2.5-hour blocks in July 2023.  The workshop will be delivered using Zoom web conferencing software along with R-Studio &quot;in the cloud&quot;.☁️ You will need (free) accounts for both pieces of\r\n software (<a href=\"https://zoom.us\" title=\"https://zoom.us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mIJwtkjNNHQhFS-re8P24\">https://zoom.us</a> and\r\n<a href=\"https://posit.cloud\" title=\"https://posit.cloud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39c23JdjIwR9FAaj4Az1ku\">\r\nhttps://posit.cloud</a>). There will be an internet connection testing and general orientation session the week of 26 June 2023.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"border-spacing:0px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:66.8571px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://posit.cloud/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-z9kcCS1TXV_Hj61PpUBB\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"240\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/1-WZLz5eUgbFPRPB1TWSOr08uPIWYR5TDm-ptqST_Fkhg1FfC7pDtzEPZJHlMR47WdI4W8gV6TZ17ijiXQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://posit.cloud/images/posit-cloud.jpg\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://posit.cloud/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-z9kcCS1TXV_Hj61PpUBB\">Posit Cloud - Do, share, teach, and learn data science</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(166,166,166)\">\r\nposit.cloud</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"border-spacing:0px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:160px;overflow:hidden\">\r\n<a href=\"https://zoom.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Z5BPFB-AZ2Fr6x_PYEtjH\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/SetCWzR1clINWlKF9dBurl-UluRo4yKzT-gjqpNCoKKcGLuiNxkzlRdPkueF0ciMSshNTYCH9SFoerKAXN-vbHGeJMA-3Sw=s0-d-e1-ft#https://st3.zoom.us/static/6.3.12613/image/thumb.png\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://zoom.us/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Z5BPFB-AZ2Fr6x_PYEtjH\">One platform to connect | Zoom</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">\r\nModernize workflows with Zoom&#39;s trusted collaboration tools: including video meetings, team chat, VoIP phone, webinars, whiteboard, contact center, and events.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(166,166,166)\">\r\n<a href=\"http://zoom.us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zoom.us&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pnmW3OkrwbUYux-GACjzR\">zoom.us</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><b><br>\r\n</b></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\"><b>Widening participation scholarship</b></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>One place will have the registration fee waived, for participants from under-represented groups.  Details of eligibility and application process at\r\n<a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation\" title=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CeYceqkMPvyYCvsNxYgSu\">\r\nhttp://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation</a>. Deadline for<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><i> scholarship applications\r\n</i></span>for the July 2023 introductory workshop is <span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\">\r\n<b>19 May 2023</b></span>.   </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><b><span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Important details</span></b></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Workshop dates and time:  10-21 July 2023; 1400-1630 British Standard Time.\r\n</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Registration deadline: 21 June 2023📅</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Enrolment limit: 14</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Cost: 225 British pounds 💵</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">What is included: Lectures, exercises, code, data all available online📃</li></ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><b><span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Additional details</span></b></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jul-2023.html\" title=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jul-2023.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jul-2023.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472157639000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SYBCFYqsfHjlz-RIEvpy7\">http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jul-2023.html</a></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>At the webpage above, you will find a link to the St Andrews online shop where payment is made.\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><i>Registration will open the week of 22 May 2023</i></span>.  After you register, I will contact you with additional details regarding workshop electronic materials, etc.\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Feel free to contact me with questions. Please share this announcement with interested colleagues.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Eric Rexstad</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Centre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">University of St Andrews</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Registered Charity in Scotland SC013532</span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
